## 10. Minimal working example

```yaml
---
title: "Your Title Here (aim for ~60-65 characters)"
excerpt: "One or two sentences — used for meta description and listing cards."
date: "2026-08-08"
author: "Jyotika Verma"
category: "Trends"
image: "/images/nailfeed/your-image.jpg"
imageAlt: "Descriptive alt text of what's in the hero image"
imageWidth: 1200
imageHeight: 675
readTime: "3 min"
topic: "some-blog-pillar-topic-slug"
topicalMap:
  parentPillar: "/blog/some-blog-pillar-topic-slug"
  relatedClusters:
    - "another-nailfeed-post-slug"
  primaryKeyword: "your primary keyword"
  secondaryKeywords:
    - "secondary keyword one"
  topicalBoundary: "One sentence on what this post covers vs. doesn't."
tldr:
  summary:
    - "**Bolded key point** in plain language."
    - "Second summary bullet."
  keyTakeaways:
    - "Actionable takeaway one."
  tldrFaqs:
    - question: "Short teaser question?"
      answer: "Short teaser answer."
faqItems:
  - question: "Fuller FAQ question?"
    answer: "Fuller FAQ answer, different content from tldrFaqs above."
---

## First section heading

Body content here.

## Second section heading

More body content — this is roughly where the mid-content newsletter
and social block will land, since it's the h2 closest to the midpoint.

## Third section heading

Closing content.
```

